WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.770
OpenAI replies. Explicitly Save Lighthouse text.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.694
New conversation. Select Harbor.

00:00:16.694 --> 00:00:23.314
Name Harbor, then explicitly Save its reply.

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:26.116
Two independent browser text documents.

00:00:26.116 --> 00:00:32.266
Reload clears SDK identity and captured events.

00:00:32.266 --> 00:00:35.150
Load Lighthouse text. No request or write.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:45.390
OpenAI remembers Lighthouse. Explicitly Save.

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:48.320
Only this page’s captured events are replayed.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:01:02.704
Replay is read-only. No requests or writes.

00:01:02.704 --> 00:01:08.000
Back live.
